        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Half-Life: Decay",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Half-Life: Decay is an expansion pack for Valve Software's science fiction, first-person shooter video game Half-Life. Developed by Gearbox Software and published by Sierra Entertainment, Decay was released as part of the PlayStation 2 version of Half-Life. It is the third expansion pack for Half-Life, and like its predecessors, Decay returns to the setting and timeline of the original story, albeit portraying the story from the viewpoint of a different set of protagonists: two scientists working in the Black Mesa Research Facility. Decay is a cooperative multiplayer game, designed to be played by two people working together to pass through the game's levels.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Half-Life: Decay es un paquete de expansión del videojuego de ciencia ficción y disparos en primera persona Half-Life, de Valve Software. Desarrollado por Gearbox Software y publicado por Sierra Entertainment, Decay se lanzó como parte de la versión para PlayStation 2 de Half-Life. Es la tercera expansión de Half-Life y, como sus predecesoras, regresa al escenario y a la línea temporal de la historia original, aunque la narra desde el punto de vista de otros protagonistas: dos científicos que trabajan en la Black Mesa Research Facility. Decay es un juego multijugador cooperativo, diseñado para que dos personas trabajen juntas y superen los niveles del juego.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2001",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
