        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Half-Life is a 1998 first-person shooter (FPS) game developed by Valve Corporation and published by Sierra Studios for Windows. It was Valve's debut product and the first game in the Half-Life series. The player assumes the role of Gordon Freeman, a theoretical physicist who must escape from the Black Mesa Research Facility after it is overrun by aliens following a disastrous scientific experiment. Its gameplay consists of diverse combat, exploration and puzzles.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Half-Life es un videojuego de disparos en primera persona (FPS) de 1998 desarrollado por Valve Corporation y publicado por Sierra Studios para Windows. Fue el primer producto de Valve y el primer juego de la serie Half-Life. El jugador asume el papel de Gordon Freeman, un físico teórico que debe escapar de la Black Mesa Research Facility tras ser invadida por alienígenas a causa de un desastroso experimento científico. Su jugabilidad combina combates variados, exploración y puzles.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
